{"about":{"kind":"code"},"description":{"overview":"Checkout p99 jumps to 4.2 s on the hour. The cause is one flat cache TTL.","standard":"Every cached price expires exactly 3600 s after it was warmed, so all 41 keys die together at the top of the hour and every miss races to Postgres at once, saturating the 20-connection pool. Jittering the TTL spreads the expiries over ten minutes and the spike becomes a plateau."},"head_sha":"79e700f1a10a74b3f65672f57f20ccb1deb4a85d","ledger":null,"nibbles":[{"n":1,"title":"One `getPrice` call touches three things; the **cache** is where the trouble starts.","description":{"overview":"The cache sits between checkout and Postgres; misses go straight through.","standard":"checkout-api calls getPrice per item. A hit returns from memory; a miss runs a SELECT through the shared pool. The pool has 20 connections, so correlated misses are the only way this picture hurts — which is exactly what synchronized expiry produces."},"visual":{"kind":"map","title":"What a checkout touches","nodes":[{"id":"web","label":"web","tier":"edge","level":"standard"},{"id":"checkout","label":"checkout-api","tier":"service","focus":true,"detail":"the endpoint under review"},{"id":"cache","label":"price cache","tier":"service","group":"pricing"},{"id":"db","label":"postgres pool","tier":"data"}],"edges":[{"from":"web","to":"checkout","label":"POST /checkout","style":"flow","level":"standard"},{"from":"checkout","to":"cache","label":"getPrice(sku)","style":"flow"},{"from":"cache","to":"db","label":"SELECT on miss","style":"miss"}]},"refs":[{"ref":"src/api/checkout.ts:3-9 @checkout the endpoint","path":"src/api/checkout.ts","start":3,"end":9,"anchor":"checkout","note":"the endpoint","trust":{"level":"exact","line":3,"shift":0}},{"ref":"src/cache/prices.ts:9-11 @cache the cache-first read","path":"src/cache/prices.ts","start":9,"end":11,"anchor":"cache","note":"the cache-first read","trust":{"level":"exact","line":9,"shift":0}},{"ref":"src/db/pool.ts:4-7 @db p